# Runtime memory store — the memoryNote resolver rewrites this on every call, and a
# unit test that touches it must not leave state in the tree (it made the suite
# self-poisoning: baseline passed, post-draft failed, every compose went UNFAVORABLE).
memory/

# Claude Code agent worktrees. These are throwaway checkouts that live INSIDE
# the repo; committing one records a gitlink with no .gitmodules entry, which
# makes `git submodule update --recursive` fail for every consumer (it broke the
# super-repo glue refresh, so the reach-oracle worktrees silently lagged).
.claude/worktrees/
